* c0228 | condition S3
Ipz pzn pzp SINE(0 0.00012 100)
Cpz pzp pzn 2.5e-08
Rpz pzp pzn 2e+07
RL out 0 1e+07
Ictl1 out 0 5e-07
C1 0 out 1.72948e-06
D1 0 pzn DSCH
D2 0 pzp DSCH
D3 pzn n1 DSCH
D4 pzp n1 DSCH
D5 n2 n3 DSI
D6 n3 n4 DSI
D7 n4 0 DSI
D8 n5 n2 DSI
D9 n5 out DZ33
L1 n1 out 0.00614104 Rser=32.7052
L2 n6 pzp 0.00919159 Rser=47.958
S1 n6 pzn G1_g 0 SWI
VG1 G1_g 0 PULSE(0 1 0.00495743 100n 100n 4.71162e-05 0.005)
Rbleed_pzp pzp 0 1G
Rbleed_pzn pzn 0 1G
Rbleed_n1 n1 0 1G
Rbleed_n2 n2 0 1G
Rbleed_n3 n3 0 1G
Rbleed_n4 n4 0 1G
Rbleed_n5 n5 0 1G
Rbleed_n6 n6 0 1G
